Package: l10n-conv
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Universal localization file converter, validator, and compiler
 l10n-conv converts between various localization file formats including
 PO, XLIFF, JSON, YAML, TS, Properties, ARB, Strings, and TOML.
 It also provides validation and compilation features similar to
 lupdate and lrelease for all l10n formats.
